 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-06-04",
   "text": "Total Recall Act\n This bill modifies the notification requirements for consumer product recalls, including by requiring manufacturers, distributors, importers, or retailers subject to certain recall orders by the Consumer Product Safety Commission to advertise such recalls based on their previous marketing expenditures and to publish notification of such recalls on their websites and on social media."
  }
